# Byte-stability gate for vendored raw data.
# -text unsets git's line-ending conversion (the correctness-critical half) so
# data/raw/*.csv is stored and checked out byte-exact, regardless of the local
# core.autocrlf setting. -diff stops git from attempting textual diffs of a
# multi-megabyte data file (ergonomic only).
#
# Do NOT add a broader normalization rule (e.g. `* text=auto`) to this file —
# that would defeat this specific unset for data/raw/*.csv.
data/raw/*.csv -text -diff
